{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.poster.avif?t=1772376334\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.webm?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.mp4?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After what felt like an eternity, the static from the radio crackled, delivering a chilling message: Nobody is coming. A cold fury surged through you, replacing the despair that had kept you a prisoner in inaction. You would not wait for a savior who would never arrive; you would become one.<br><br>This is <strong>survival horror in its purest form</strong>: tense, atmospheric, and unrelenting. Every last bit of resource is precious and every mistake brings you closer to death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/1100b0682a13dea0daea17096c031980.poster.avif?t=1772376334\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/1100b0682a13dea0daea17096c031980.webm?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/1100b0682a13dea0daea17096c031980.mp4?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Survival Horror Gameplay</strong><br>Navigate desolate streets and claustrophobic interiors, where danger lurks around every corner. Solve puzzles and face the terrors that will force a choice: <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>flee</strong>, or <strong>die</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Scarcity and Tension</strong><br>Resources are scarce. Do you risk using your last bullet to take down a monster, or do you save it for a more critical moment and hope to slip past unnoticed? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diegetic Grid-Based Inventory</strong><br>Every single item matters, and space is a luxury you can't afford. Carefully manage your limited inventory grid, making agonizing choices about what to carry and what to leave behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No HUD, No Distractions</strong><br>No health bars, no ammo counters, no intrusive menus. Every piece of information is conveyed through your character and the world around you. Your only interface is your own perception.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.poster.avif?t=1772376334\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.webm?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.mp4?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Weapon System</strong><br>Check your magazines manually, round by precious round, and reload with deliberate, step-by-step actions. Every firefight becomes a tense test of your nerves and skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bleak and Oppressive Atmosphere</strong><br>Rain-slick cobblestones and flickering fluorescent lights lead you deeper into a town that feels cold, hostile, and suffocating. The distant cries of things that should not exist echo through its desolate streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Return to Forgotten Horror Traditions</strong><br>Fear comes from the atmosphere, the gnawing uncertainty, and the constant presence of death. The story is told through  the environment itself, and combat is a slow, methodical dance where every shot matters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001350?t=1772376334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001350?t=1772376334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/435d37e79c8530467740d1618a8befec1fdccf08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772376334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/435d37e79c8530467740d1618a8befec1fdccf08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772376334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4129130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.poster.avif?t=1772376334\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.webm?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/0b21f897441acc72d4b493a299ea2776.mp4?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p