 behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No HUD, No Distractions</strong><br>No health bars, no ammo counters, no intrusive menus. Every piece of information is conveyed through your character and the world around you. Your only interface is your own perception.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.poster.avif?t=1772376334\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.webm?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001350/extras/766ee139ef82daeec9e9bae4ae0d12fc.mp4?t=1772376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Weapon System</strong><br>Check your magazines manually, round by precious round, and reload with deliberate, step-by-step actions. Every firefight becomes a tense test of your nerves and skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bleak and Oppressive Atmosphere</strong><br>Rain-slick cobblestones and flickering fluorescent lights lead you deeper into a town that feels cold, hostile, and suffocating. The distant cries of things that should not exist echo through its desolate streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Return to Forgotten Horror Traditions</strong><br>Fear comes from the atmosphere, the gnawing uncertainty, and the constant presence of death. The story is told through  the environment itself, and combat is a slow, methodical dance where every shot matters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ronesans Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"ht